WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:27.120
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:27.390 --> 01:34.910
[The Great Long March]

3
01:35.330 --> 01:37.759
[Episode 21]

4
01:38.500 --> 01:40.220
I agree with Comrade Mao Zedong's opinion.

5
01:38.620 --> 01:42.120
[Military Commission Headquarters on Baima Mountain, Guizhou]

6
01:41.520 --> 01:44.050
I hope the tragedy of the Battle of Xiang River

7
01:45.930 --> 01:47.130
will not be repeated.

8
01:56.210 --> 01:57.050
I agree.

9
01:57.570 --> 01:58.330
I agree.

10
01:58.520 --> 01:59.440
I agree.

11
02:00.860 --> 02:01.860
I agree too.

12
02:07.240 --> 02:07.960
Good.

13
02:08.520 --> 02:09.960
Since no one has any objections,

14
02:09.960 --> 02:10.889
it's decided.

15
02:11.520 --> 02:12.640
We will divide the work.

16
02:12.640 --> 02:13.730
For specific arrangements,

17
02:13.730 --> 02:15.640
Comrades Zhu De and Liu Bocheng

18
02:15.760 --> 02:17.240
will be in charge of commanding the frontline troops

19
02:17.240 --> 02:18.960
to quickly disengage from the enemy

20
02:18.960 --> 02:20.010
and withdraw in sequence.

21
02:20.010 --> 02:21.410
Comrade Ye Jianying and I

22
02:21.560 --> 02:22.829
will lead the engineering troops

23
02:22.829 --> 02:24.320
to build a pontoon bridge over the Chishui River

24
02:24.320 --> 02:25.800
and organize the troops to cross.

25
02:25.800 --> 02:26.730
Comrade Chen Yun

26
02:26.960 --> 02:28.960
will be responsible for settling and transferring the wounded.

27
02:28.960 --> 02:29.690
Understood.

28
02:29.890 --> 02:30.950
Comrade Mao Zedong

29
02:32.310 --> 02:34.760
will stay at the Military Commission headquarters to command.

30
02:34.760 --> 02:35.810
While I am away,

31
02:36.079 --> 02:37.170
if there are any changes,

32
02:37.170 --> 02:39.170
you are free to decide as you see fit.

33
02:39.240 --> 02:39.890
Okay.

34
02:47.600 --> 02:51.660
Commander-in-Chief, an urgent telegram from the Military Commission!

35
02:52.510 --> 02:53.230
Great.

36
02:53.440 --> 02:54.770
It's still Mao's style.

37
02:55.120 --> 02:56.100
Fight if we can win,

38
02:56.100 --> 02:57.290
leave if we can't.

39
02:58.170 --> 02:59.630
Bocheng, notify all Corps

40
02:59.770 --> 03:00.440
to prepare to withdraw.

41
03:00.440 --> 03:01.190
Yes.

42
03:03.560 --> 03:09.520
[Chishui River, Guizhou]

43
03:06.450 --> 03:08.970
On January 29, 1935,

44
03:09.340 --> 03:11.360
under orders from the Central Revolutionary Military Commission,

45
03:11.360 --> 03:12.680
all participating troops,

46
03:12.680 --> 03:15.240
except for a small force left to block the enemy,

47
03:15.240 --> 03:17.490
had all their main forces withdraw in the early hours of the morning,

48
03:17.490 --> 03:19.240
secretly leaving their position.

49
03:19.240 --> 03:20.000
At dawn,

50
03:20.560 --> 03:24.210
the Corps and the Military Commission Column divided into three routes,

51
03:24.210 --> 03:25.750
crossing from Yuanhouchang,

52
03:25.750 --> 03:27.590
the upper and lower ferries of Tucheng, and other places,

53
03:27.590 --> 03:29.290
westward over the Chishui River,

54
03:29.290 --> 03:32.490
advancing towards the Gulin and Xuyong areas in Sichuan.

55
03:48.920 --> 03:49.850
Little comrade.

56
03:50.520 --> 03:51.250
Are you okay?

57
03:51.380 --> 03:52.360
I'm fine, Chairman.

58
03:52.360 --> 03:53.490
Just a minor injury.

59
03:56.670 --> 03:57.579
Comrades,

60
03:58.560 --> 03:59.890
hold on a little longer!

61
03:59.910 --> 04:01.170
Cross the river first!

62
04:03.650 --> 04:05.850
Chairman, let's cross the river first.

63
04:12.990 --> 04:13.830
Come on!

64
04:14.730 --> 04:15.560
Come on!

65
04:17.010 --> 04:17.649
Come on!

66
04:21.610 --> 04:22.290
Cross the river in order!

67
04:22.290 --> 04:23.610
One, two, three!

68
04:23.610 --> 04:25.880
Pay attention to the discipline of crossing the river!

69
04:25.880 --> 04:28.090
One, two, three!

70
04:28.320 --> 04:30.410
One, two, three!

71
04:30.800 --> 04:33.090
One, two, three!

72
04:33.409 --> 04:35.000
One, two, three!

73
04:35.560 --> 04:37.360
One, two, three!

74
04:37.360 --> 04:38.320
What's going on?

75
04:39.240 --> 04:40.700
The mountain gun is stuck!

76
04:41.550 --> 04:42.510
It's stuck.

77
04:50.409 --> 04:51.170
Sink it!

78
04:51.409 --> 04:52.409
Corps Commander,

79
04:52.800 --> 04:54.300
we've only got this one mountain gun left.

80
04:54.300 --> 04:55.620
Can we keep it?

81
04:56.000 --> 04:58.380
It made great contributions at Qinggangpo.

82
04:58.380 --> 05:00.500
If our artillery company has no guns,

83
05:01.120 --> 05:02.290
how can we be called artillery?

84
05:02.290 --> 05:03.240
Yes, that's right.

85
05:03.240 --> 05:04.000
This is the only gun left!

86
05:04.000 --> 05:04.970
Let's keep it.

87
05:07.050 --> 05:07.850
But comrades,

88
05:08.530 --> 05:10.130
we are all Red Army soldiers.

89
05:10.680 --> 05:12.560
We must obey the orders of our superiors.

90
05:12.560 --> 05:14.410
The order given to us by the Military Commission

91
05:14.410 --> 05:16.290
is to throw away all heavy weapons

92
05:16.530 --> 05:17.490
and supplies

93
05:17.880 --> 05:18.930
and march light.

94
05:19.490 --> 05:20.730
Now we leave it behind

95
05:21.760 --> 05:23.410
just to win the battle!

96
05:26.440 --> 05:27.290
Comrades,

97
05:28.200 --> 05:29.880
we have suffered a great loss

98
05:30.120 --> 05:32.490
from marching with heavy loads before.

99
05:32.800 --> 05:34.730
So many comrades have sacrificed.

100
05:35.050 --> 05:36.200
So today,

101
05:37.810 --> 05:39.940
we cannot make the same mistake again.

102
05:40.650 --> 05:41.380
Sink the gun!

103
05:41.800 --> 05:42.530
Yes!

104
05:43.100 --> 05:45.560
We'll firmly execute the superior's order.

105
05:59.800 --> 06:00.530
Sink the gun!

106
06:00.800 --> 06:01.610
Yes!

107
06:01.640 --> 06:02.810
Sink the gun!

108
06:03.850 --> 06:06.680
One, two, three!

109
06:07.290 --> 06:10.410
One, two, three!

110
06:44.930 --> 06:47.460
Commander-in-Chief! Commander-in-Chief!

111
06:49.760 --> 06:50.420
Old friend!

112
06:50.440 --> 06:51.730
Commander-in-Chief Zhu.

113
06:51.730 --> 06:52.409
Old friend!

114
06:52.409 --> 06:53.680
Commander-in-Chief Zhu, you're finally back!

115
06:53.680 --> 06:54.440
Old friend.

116
06:54.930 --> 06:55.540
I heard

117
06:55.560 --> 06:57.490
you insisted on being the last one to leave the battlefield!

118
06:57.490 --> 06:59.560
You insisted on being the last one to leave the battlefield, right?

119
06:59.560 --> 07:00.910
I'm fine, aren't I?

120
07:01.400 --> 07:02.200
I said

121
07:02.610 --> 07:03.740
the enemy's bullets

122
07:04.090 --> 07:05.440
can't hit me.

123
07:07.420 --> 07:08.180
Chairman.

124
07:08.770 --> 07:10.570
Comrade Bocheng, good job.

125
07:12.420 --> 07:13.420
Old friend.

126
07:14.250 --> 07:16.280
Now you can smoke in peace.

127
07:24.850 --> 07:26.170
I can't bear to smoke it.

128
07:26.170 --> 07:27.500
I can't bear to smoke it!

129
07:29.380 --> 07:30.230
Chairman,

130
07:30.800 --> 07:32.060
Commander-in-Chief.

131
07:32.220 --> 07:33.270
We can cross the river now.

132
07:33.270 --> 07:33.840
Good.

133
07:34.080 --> 07:34.970
Let's go.

134
07:38.510 --> 07:39.640
The Chishui River's

135
07:40.230 --> 07:43.870
main stream is about 436.5 kilometers long,

136
07:44.170 --> 07:47.560
with a total drop of about 1,475 meters.

137
07:48.330 --> 07:51.290
It flows through Yunnan, Guizhou, and Sichuan provinces,

138
07:51.290 --> 07:52.550
with a total basin area

139
07:52.659 --> 07:55.260
of about 20,440 square kilometers.

140
07:56.170 --> 07:59.460
Because the river flows through the mountainous area of Danxia landform,

141
07:59.460 --> 08:01.790
the river water is red in the rainy season,

142
08:02.040 --> 08:04.440
hence the name, meaning "Red Water River."

143
08:04.560 --> 08:07.680
Among all the rivers in China, Chishui River

144
08:07.680 --> 08:09.080
is not considered large.

145
08:09.680 --> 08:11.440
But more than 90 years ago,

146
08:11.650 --> 08:13.330
it witnessed a

147
08:13.360 --> 08:15.730
spectacle in the history of war,

148
08:16.050 --> 08:19.380
known in history as the Four Crossings of the Chishui River.

149
08:28.580 --> 08:33.730
[Nanchang Headquarters, Jiangxi]

150
08:29.560 --> 08:30.880
Did you two notice

151
08:31.340 --> 08:33.669
the camellias blooming all along the way?

152
08:34.440 --> 08:35.440
I wonder

153
08:36.010 --> 08:37.610
what the temperature is now.

154
08:37.799 --> 08:38.440
According to the forecast,

155
08:38.289 --> 08:40.630
[Yan Daogang, Director of the Aide-de-Camp Office of the Generalissimo of the Military Affairs Commission of the Nationalist Government]

156
08:38.559 --> 08:41.320
the highest temperature today is 15 degrees Celsius.

157
08:41.320 --> 08:42.890
I really didn't expect

158
08:44.480 --> 08:45.960
the winter in Jiangxi

159
08:46.370 --> 08:47.840
to be so sunny.

160
08:48.550 --> 08:49.750
What night is this,

161
08:49.800 --> 08:51.370
talking of home here in a strange land?

162
08:51.370 --> 08:52.480
On our way here,

163
08:52.600 --> 08:55.290
we saw the camellias blooming beautifully.

164
08:55.320 --> 08:56.680
I wonder what kind of miserable state

165
08:56.680 --> 08:58.820
the Zhu-Mao Communist army in the bitter cold of southern Sichuan

166
08:58.820 --> 09:01.080
is in right now.

167
09:01.150 --> 09:02.790
[Chen Cheng Commander-in-Chief of the Kuomintang Army's Reserve Forces in Jiangxi]

168
09:01.420 --> 09:03.350
It is exactly as the Song poet said:

169
09:04.560 --> 09:06.410
"When these flourish, those then decline."

170
09:06.410 --> 09:07.200
Oh, right,

171
09:07.560 --> 09:08.960
about the Communist army on the opposite side,

172
09:08.960 --> 09:10.620
is there any new information?

173
09:11.440 --> 09:13.650
Since the Zhu-Mao Communist army crossed the Chishui River westward,

174
09:13.650 --> 09:14.990
they split into two routes.

175
09:14.990 --> 09:17.140
One route fled south towards Gulin,

176
09:17.290 --> 09:19.800
and the other invaded Xuyong County to the west.

177
09:19.800 --> 09:20.950
However, the Sichuan Army

178
09:20.950 --> 09:22.010
has already built two defense lines

179
09:22.010 --> 09:23.290
on the south bank of the Yangtze River.

180
09:23.290 --> 09:25.370
Plus, we are using five brigades

181
09:25.410 --> 09:27.140
to pursue them with full force.

182
09:27.480 --> 09:29.540
If they want to go north into Sichuan,

183
09:29.680 --> 09:31.600
all roads are basically blocked.

184
09:34.480 --> 09:36.530
The Communist army is our old rival.

185
09:37.320 --> 09:40.200
They will definitely not just sit and wait for death.

186
09:40.200 --> 09:41.590
Fleeing west to southern Sichuan

187
09:41.590 --> 09:43.050
is just a stopgap measure.

188
09:44.170 --> 09:44.850
Oh, right,

189
09:45.120 --> 09:47.520
Long Yun sent me a telegram a few days ago,

190
09:47.840 --> 09:51.440
saying the Communist army will undoubtedly cross the river upstream of Yibin.

191
09:51.440 --> 09:52.250
It's rare

192
09:52.500 --> 09:55.230
for Long Zhizhou (Long Yun) to have such insight.

193
09:56.050 --> 10:00.120
If the Communist army really crosses the river from upstream,

194
10:00.720 --> 10:02.390
relying solely on Liu Xiang's Sichuan Army

195
10:02.390 --> 10:03.630
might not be enough.

196
10:04.720 --> 10:06.480
The three brigades of Sun Du's Yunnan Army

197
10:06.480 --> 10:08.440
have been stationed in Bijie for some time.

198
10:08.440 --> 10:10.040
If his troops can move north,

199
10:10.170 --> 10:11.840
the Communist army will have nowhere to run.

200
10:11.840 --> 10:14.890
The provinces cannot each mind only their own business.

201
10:14.890 --> 10:17.130
To encircle and suppress the Communist army, we must use the Yunnan Army.

202
10:17.130 --> 10:19.290
Long Zhizhou (Long Yun) must be involved.

203
10:19.290 --> 10:20.720
But this Long Yun...

204
10:20.930 --> 10:22.320
I'm worried he's not as obedient as

205
10:22.320 --> 10:24.600
Wang Jialie, Liu Xiang, and He Jian.

206
10:25.720 --> 10:27.930
Which of these big shots is obedient?

207
10:27.950 --> 10:29.340
They all just want to

208
10:29.390 --> 10:31.320
hold onto their own little piece of land.

209
10:31.320 --> 10:32.170
Therefore,

210
10:32.610 --> 10:35.200
we need to give him a little taste of sweetness.

211
10:35.200 --> 10:36.680
I've already thought about it.

212
10:36.680 --> 10:38.130
Let Xue Yue's Second Army Group

213
10:38.130 --> 10:40.480
cooperate with the armies of Yunnan and Guizhou provinces

214
10:40.480 --> 10:43.200
to form the Second Route Army of the Pursuit Army

215
10:43.410 --> 10:44.890
to coordinate with the Sichuan Army.

216
10:44.890 --> 10:47.010
Xue Yue will be the Frontline Commander-in-Chief,

217
10:47.010 --> 10:48.930
and Long Yun will be the Commander-in-Chief.

218
10:48.930 --> 10:52.630
We must annihilate the Communist army in southern Sichuan.

219
10:53.010 --> 10:53.800
Understood.

220
11:00.840 --> 11:02.570
Warfare grinds on without end.

221
11:03.080 --> 11:05.600
The passes and mountains ahead lie dim and distant.

222
11:05.600 --> 11:06.890
We both are soldiers,

223
11:08.010 --> 11:10.340
and we both are fighting in a foreign land.

224
11:10.550 --> 11:11.670
What we see

225
11:12.040 --> 11:14.830
is bright sunshine and vibrant camellias.

226
11:15.770 --> 11:16.720
I really want to know

227
11:16.720 --> 11:18.650
what kind of scene

228
11:18.960 --> 11:21.360
the Communist army thousands of miles away

229
11:22.730 --> 11:25.010
sees before their eyes.

230
11:26.420 --> 11:33.750
[Kunming, Yunnan]

231
11:47.990 --> 11:49.290
I haven't seen you for a few months,

232
11:49.290 --> 11:51.060
and your martial arts have improved a lot, my cousin.

233
11:51.060 --> 11:52.010
Come on.

234
11:52.090 --> 11:54.300
[Long Yun, Chairman of the Yunnan Provincial Government of the Kuomintang]

235
11:53.050 --> 11:54.450
You're just holding back

236
11:54.480 --> 11:55.600
to save my face.

237
11:56.570 --> 11:58.310
[Lu Han, Director of Yunnan Provincial Committee of the Kuomintang]

238
11:57.200 --> 11:58.930
I can't hide anything from you.

239
12:03.720 --> 12:04.410
Report!

240
12:05.010 --> 12:06.440
Urgent telegram from Generalissimo Chiang.

241
12:06.440 --> 12:07.160
Read it.

242
12:10.400 --> 12:11.210
Long Yun is hereby appointed

243
12:11.210 --> 12:13.460
as the Commander-in-Chief of the Second Route of the Pursuit Army.

244
12:13.460 --> 12:14.600
Xue Yue is appointed as the Pursuit Army's

245
12:14.600 --> 12:16.720
Frontline Commander-in-Chief of the Second Route.

246
12:16.720 --> 12:19.560
Wu Qiwei is appointed as the Commander of the First Column.

247
12:19.560 --> 12:21.890
Zhou Hunyuan is appointed as the Commander of the Second Column.

248
12:21.890 --> 12:23.370
Commander-in-Chief Long will select an officer

249
12:23.370 --> 12:24.930
to be the Commander of the Third Column.

250
12:24.930 --> 12:27.770
Wang Jialie is appointed as the Commander of the Fourth Column.

251
12:27.770 --> 12:30.970
For your information and attention by special telegram.

252
12:36.250 --> 12:37.440
This Chiang

253
12:37.910 --> 12:39.270
is a real Taiji master.

254
12:39.800 --> 12:41.320
With just a double push,

255
12:41.770 --> 12:45.970
he pushed the heavy responsibility of suppressing the Communists onto me.

256
12:46.320 --> 12:49.480
Now the Communist army's goal is to go north into Sichuan.

257
12:49.480 --> 12:52.130
Why would Chiang appoint you

258
12:52.200 --> 12:54.300
as the Commander-in-Chief of the Second Route Pursuit Army?

259
12:54.300 --> 12:57.160
With Xue Yue as the Frontline Commander-in-Chief,

260
12:57.200 --> 12:59.800
who else can I command besides the Yunnan Army?

261
13:00.080 --> 13:02.080
He just wants the Yunnan Army to send troops

262
13:02.080 --> 13:03.650
for them to use.

263
13:03.980 --> 13:05.670
Then you should just refuse.

264
13:08.100 --> 13:10.100
I can't refuse.

265
13:10.480 --> 13:13.720
Liu Xiang and He Guoguang just

266
13:14.010 --> 13:16.010
sent me an urgent telegram jointly.

267
13:16.130 --> 13:17.990
The underlying meaning is clear.

268
13:18.290 --> 13:20.490
If the Yunnan Army doesn't send troops,

269
13:20.650 --> 13:23.180
they will drive the Communist army to Yunnan.

270
13:23.970 --> 13:26.170
Once the Communist army enters Yunnan,

271
13:26.300 --> 13:28.570
the Central Army will follow soon.

272
13:29.050 --> 13:29.930
So,

273
13:30.480 --> 13:32.400
the Communist army must not enter Yunnan.

274
13:32.400 --> 13:35.320
Even if it costs us something, we won't begrudge it.

275
13:36.010 --> 13:37.250
You mean

276
13:37.440 --> 13:39.440
you agree to take the post of Commander-in-Chief

277
13:39.440 --> 13:41.200
and send troops to suppress the Communists?

278
13:41.200 --> 13:42.650
I can't avoid it anyway.

279
13:42.680 --> 13:45.170
Having the title of Commander-in-Chief is better than nothing.

280
13:45.170 --> 13:46.370
Let's accept it first

281
13:46.580 --> 13:49.640
and appoint Sun Du as the Commander of the Third Column.

282
13:49.930 --> 13:51.640
As for sending troops,

283
13:51.930 --> 13:54.060
let's figure out the situation first.

284
13:54.900 --> 13:57.340
I heard that Chen Jitang in Guangdong

285
13:57.540 --> 13:58.780
invented a word,

286
13:59.340 --> 14:00.460
"work smart."

287
14:01.740 --> 14:02.690
This old fox.

288
14:09.130 --> 14:09.890
Powerful!

289
14:22.020 --> 14:31.820
[Shixiangzi Village, Xuyong County, Sichuan]

290
14:22.320 --> 14:23.440
South of the Yangtze River,

291
14:23.440 --> 14:25.970
the Sichuan army has built two defense lines.

292
14:26.080 --> 14:28.600
We can't get through no matter what.

293
14:32.930 --> 14:34.730
Regarding the next action plan,

294
14:35.730 --> 14:37.530
does anyone have any good ideas?

295
14:44.620 --> 14:45.880
There are no new plans,

296
14:46.320 --> 14:49.170
but we should still summarize the old lessons.

297
14:49.300 --> 14:51.360
I didn't say we shouldn't summarize.

298
14:51.740 --> 14:53.340
Things have priorities.

299
14:53.770 --> 14:55.360
Then where exactly is the problem?

300
14:55.360 --> 14:56.570
I'll summarize.

301
14:57.960 --> 14:59.360
In the Battle of Tucheng,

302
14:59.560 --> 15:00.960
there are three lessons.

303
15:01.560 --> 15:02.350
First,

304
15:03.050 --> 15:05.510
we didn't figure out the enemy's situation.

305
15:05.600 --> 15:07.440
We originally thought there were four Regiments,

306
15:07.440 --> 15:09.720
but the enemy actually had six Regiments,

307
15:09.720 --> 15:11.600
with three more Regiments following behind.

308
15:11.600 --> 15:12.370
Second,

309
15:13.130 --> 15:14.730
regarding the Sichuan army,

310
15:14.790 --> 15:16.910
the combat effectiveness of Guo Xunqi's troops

311
15:16.910 --> 15:18.110
was underestimated.

312
15:18.720 --> 15:20.770
We made the mistake of underestimating the enemy.

313
15:20.770 --> 15:21.530
Third,

314
15:21.850 --> 15:23.520
we shouldn't have let the First Corps

315
15:23.520 --> 15:26.330
attack Chishui County alone,

316
15:27.290 --> 15:28.890
which dispersed our forces.

317
15:32.600 --> 15:34.200
Lessons must be summarized,

318
15:34.860 --> 15:37.130
and experiences must be absorbed.

319
15:38.250 --> 15:41.560
After this battle entered a stalemate,

320
15:41.830 --> 15:43.830
we withdrew from the battle in time,

321
15:44.050 --> 15:46.310
avoiding the danger of being surrounded

322
15:46.600 --> 15:48.410
in Tucheng by the subsequent enemies.

323
15:48.410 --> 15:49.370
Being flexible,

324
15:49.800 --> 15:51.860
we gained the strategic initiative.

325
15:52.680 --> 15:54.890
But now there is the blockade of the Sichuan army in front,

326
15:54.890 --> 15:56.890
and a large number of pursuing troops behind.

327
15:56.890 --> 15:59.130
Where is our strategic initiative?

328
15:59.600 --> 16:03.250
Just now the Commander-in-Chief mentioned strategic initiative,

329
16:03.250 --> 16:05.050
and there are two words before it:

330
16:05.050 --> 16:05.980
being flexible.

331
16:06.050 --> 16:07.910
We are already being surrounded.

332
16:08.230 --> 16:09.490
How can we be flexible?

333
16:09.490 --> 16:11.440
There are other paths we can take.

334
16:12.260 --> 16:13.330
We now know

335
16:13.350 --> 16:15.990
that the Sichuan army has set up two blockades

336
16:16.480 --> 16:18.290
on our way north to cross the river.

337
16:18.290 --> 16:20.010
Then we can't walk right into the trap.

338
16:20.010 --> 16:21.410
If we can't go northwest,

339
16:21.600 --> 16:22.530
we go southwest.

340
16:22.560 --> 16:23.290
Southwest?

341
16:23.680 --> 16:24.410
Yes.

342
16:25.290 --> 16:28.890
We go to the junction of Sichuan, Yunnan, and Guizhou,

343
16:29.130 --> 16:30.320
to the Zhaxi area.

344
16:32.290 --> 16:34.440
What is the reason for going there?

345
16:35.080 --> 16:36.890
The enemy forces there are weak.

346
16:37.080 --> 16:38.280
Just this one reason?

347
16:38.290 --> 16:39.950
Isn't this one reason enough?

348
16:39.960 --> 16:40.560
Then...

349
16:41.320 --> 16:43.560
Then are we still crossing the Yangtze River?

350
16:43.560 --> 16:45.080
If conditions permit, we cross.

351
16:45.080 --> 16:46.540
If not, we delay crossing,

352
16:46.770 --> 16:48.030
or simply don't cross.

353
16:48.320 --> 16:50.560
We might cross the Yangtze River northward,

354
16:50.560 --> 16:52.530
or we might cross the Jinsha River instead.

355
16:52.530 --> 16:54.250
Crossing the river itself is not the goal.

356
16:54.250 --> 16:56.770
The goal is to get rid of the enemy's pursuit.

357
17:02.720 --> 17:04.319
Comrade Zedong's proposal,

358
17:04.359 --> 17:05.760
everyone can discuss it.

359
17:06.849 --> 17:08.380
I agree with Mao's opinion.

360
17:08.410 --> 17:10.319
When the enemy advances, we retreat, avoiding their sharp edge.

361
17:10.319 --> 17:11.040
I agree too.

362
17:11.300 --> 17:12.170
I agree too.

363
17:23.810 --> 17:24.720
Comrade Bo Gu,

364
17:25.960 --> 17:28.760
if you have any thoughts, you can speak up.

365
17:35.480 --> 17:36.810
You guys decide.

366
17:37.610 --> 17:38.810
I have no objections.

367
17:39.900 --> 17:42.100
I agree with Comrade Zedong's opinion.

368
17:42.480 --> 17:43.240
Good.

369
17:43.720 --> 17:45.330
Since everyone has no objections...

370
17:45.330 --> 17:46.390
Then it's decided.

371
17:47.040 --> 17:48.170
Telegraph all Corps

372
17:48.370 --> 17:49.900
to bypass the current enemy

373
17:50.170 --> 17:53.170
and set out separately for the Zhaxi area to assemble.

374
17:54.370 --> 17:54.900
Good.

375
17:59.570 --> 18:01.100
We've summarized our work.

376
18:02.040 --> 18:04.100
Now it's time to summarize our lives.

377
18:07.180 --> 18:08.240
I'll go take a look.

378
18:09.430 --> 18:10.080
Bocheng.

379
18:11.650 --> 18:13.100
Has everyone forgotten

380
18:13.120 --> 18:14.250
what day it is today?

381
18:14.650 --> 18:15.520
Leaders!

382
18:17.520 --> 18:18.570
Leaders!

383
18:19.720 --> 18:22.000
Today is New Year's Eve of the Jiaxu year.

384
18:19.970 --> 18:24.770
[Deng Xiaoping, Secretary-General of the CPC Central Committee]

385
18:22.560 --> 18:25.280
The Chairman asked me to set off firecrackers for everyone.

386
18:25.280 --> 18:26.090
Leaders.

387
18:26.650 --> 18:28.050
Happy New Year to you all!

388
18:28.220 --> 18:29.080
Happy New Year!

389
18:29.090 --> 18:30.680
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

390
18:30.680 --> 18:31.330
Happy New Year!

391
18:31.330 --> 18:33.060
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

392
18:33.130 --> 18:34.580
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

393
18:34.580 --> 18:36.310
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

394
18:36.520 --> 18:37.380
Happy New Year!

395
18:37.680 --> 18:39.410
Happy New Year! Happy New Year!

396
18:39.810 --> 18:40.440
Oh, right.

397
18:40.880 --> 18:41.560
The Chairman

398
18:41.560 --> 18:43.930
also specially asked me to prepare New Year's Eve dinner for everyone!

399
18:43.930 --> 18:45.200
Comrades, bring it in!

400
18:45.410 --> 18:45.760
Coming!

401
18:45.760 --> 18:47.370
What delicacies have you prepared?

402
18:47.370 --> 18:48.960
No delicacies,

403
18:49.290 --> 18:51.370
but enough Red Army food to fill you up.

404
18:51.370 --> 18:52.590
Time to celebrate the New Year!

405
18:52.590 --> 18:53.570
Careful, it's hot. Careful!

406
18:53.570 --> 18:54.810
Happy New Year, leaders!

407
18:54.810 --> 18:55.890
Happy New Year.

408
18:56.200 --> 18:58.330
Red rice and pumpkin soup.

409
18:58.610 --> 18:59.680
Very good!

410
19:01.210 --> 19:02.720
This red rice and pumpkin soup

411
19:02.720 --> 19:04.740
was hard for Comrade Xiaoping to get.

412
19:04.740 --> 19:05.850
-Let's eat. -Come on.

413
19:05.850 --> 19:06.520
Come on. Over here.

414
19:06.520 --> 19:07.980
Leaders, enjoy your meal.

415
19:08.330 --> 19:09.390
I'll be right here.

416
19:10.890 --> 19:11.820
It's delicious.

417
19:13.240 --> 19:13.850
Red rice.

418
19:13.960 --> 19:14.680
Yes. Here.

419
19:15.240 --> 19:17.200
Red rice and pumpkin soup.

420
19:17.480 --> 19:18.910
One red, one yellow.

421
19:19.240 --> 19:20.890
One is rough and hard.

422
19:21.240 --> 19:23.040
The other is sweet and smooth.

423
19:23.390 --> 19:24.520
They seem opposite,

424
19:24.960 --> 19:27.240
but when combined,

425
19:27.850 --> 19:29.250
they are a perfect match.

426
19:31.720 --> 19:32.240
Delicious.

427
19:32.240 --> 19:33.520
-It's delicious. -Tasty.

428
19:33.520 --> 19:35.810
The sweetness and smoothness of the pumpkin soup

429
19:35.810 --> 19:37.870
offset the roughness of the red rice.

430
19:38.130 --> 19:39.890
And the red rice is filling.

431
19:40.370 --> 19:41.970
They complement each other.

432
19:42.700 --> 19:43.650
Chopsticks.

433
19:43.930 --> 19:45.040
So delicious!

434
20:02.440 --> 20:03.900
Who would have thought it?

435
20:04.280 --> 20:06.370
After leaving the Central Soviet Area,

436
20:06.370 --> 20:08.500
we can still eat a bowl of Red Army food.

437
20:08.760 --> 20:10.760
This is what New Year's Eve dinner should taste like.

438
20:10.760 --> 20:11.760
It's the New Year.

439
20:12.130 --> 20:13.530
We need some atmosphere.

440
20:13.610 --> 20:15.200
Red rice and pumpkin soup.

441
20:15.720 --> 20:16.920
It's been a long time!

442
20:17.570 --> 20:18.630
Really a long time.

443
20:22.180 --> 20:24.910
Festivals only deepen one's longing for family.

444
20:25.750 --> 20:29.130
At this moment,

445
20:29.760 --> 20:33.040
who is each of you thinking of?

446
20:33.720 --> 20:34.480
Mom.

447
20:35.170 --> 20:35.960
Mother.

448
20:36.330 --> 20:37.000
Mother.

449
20:37.370 --> 20:38.170
Mom.

450
20:38.390 --> 20:39.240
Mother.

451
20:41.890 --> 20:42.700
Then let's all

452
20:43.620 --> 20:45.070
talk about our mothers.

453
20:47.600 --> 20:48.490
Mao,

454
20:49.200 --> 20:51.890
you brought up this topic,

455
20:52.170 --> 20:54.440
so you should go first.

456
20:54.710 --> 20:55.360
Exactly.

457
20:55.380 --> 20:56.900
Chairman, you go first.

458
21:01.380 --> 21:04.420
My mother was an honest and kind person.

459
21:04.680 --> 21:06.960
She always thought of others first.

460
21:08.520 --> 21:10.050
There was a small incident.

461
21:13.760 --> 21:16.420
When I was eight and attending a private school,

462
21:16.790 --> 21:18.990
there was a classmate nicknamed Heipi.

463
21:19.650 --> 21:22.610
His family was very poor and couldn't afford food.

464
21:23.130 --> 21:23.850
Every time,

465
21:24.960 --> 21:27.280
I would give him half of my food.

466
21:29.090 --> 21:29.950
After my mother

467
21:31.090 --> 21:32.520
found out about this,

468
21:32.850 --> 21:35.710
she prepared two portions of food for me every time.

469
21:37.720 --> 21:38.850
At that time,

470
21:39.170 --> 21:41.550
everyone thought I had an amazing appetite.

471
21:41.550 --> 21:43.350
My mother kept it a secret for me,

472
21:43.580 --> 21:45.780
saying it was her who had a big appetite.

473
21:46.040 --> 21:47.440
Later, people would say,

474
21:48.170 --> 21:50.430
"Why do you eat so much but never get fat?"

475
21:51.680 --> 21:54.080
My mother would puff out her cheeks and say,

476
21:54.820 --> 21:55.740
"Am I not fat?"

477
21:59.940 --> 22:01.400
My impression of my mother

478
22:01.890 --> 22:04.650
is that she always looked angry.

479
22:05.040 --> 22:07.240
Because when I was in my early twenties,

480
22:07.720 --> 22:09.780
I didn't do things the way she wanted.

481
22:10.000 --> 22:11.720
So... she

482
22:11.850 --> 22:13.510
never gave me a pleasant look.

483
22:13.930 --> 22:14.810
She didn't like...

484
22:14.810 --> 22:15.920
anything about me.

485
22:16.960 --> 22:19.440
Until 1932,

486
22:20.240 --> 22:23.440
in the News Daily of Shanghai,

487
22:23.850 --> 22:27.240
I suddenly read a missing person notice.

488
22:28.760 --> 22:29.920
"Yinggao (Zhang Wentian),

489
22:29.920 --> 22:32.320
mother is critically ill,

490
22:33.220 --> 22:35.820
hopes to see son,

491
22:36.850 --> 22:37.850
return quickly."

492
22:42.930 --> 22:44.190
But I couldn't go back.

493
22:46.000 --> 22:46.890
Actually...

494
22:47.330 --> 22:50.000
I really wanted to go back and ask my mother,

495
22:50.520 --> 22:51.720
"You're...

496
22:53.370 --> 22:55.300
not upset with me anymore, right?"

497
22:58.590 --> 23:00.050
But I never got the chance.

498
23:01.190 --> 23:02.280
She passed away

499
23:02.830 --> 23:04.180
the following year.

500
23:18.950 --> 23:19.860
Luofu,

501
23:20.930 --> 23:23.130
my mother was just the opposite of yous.

502
23:23.170 --> 23:24.280
My mother

503
23:24.890 --> 23:27.610
was always cheerful.

504
23:28.170 --> 23:31.170
We were poor tenant farmers and couldn't afford meat.

505
23:31.330 --> 23:31.760
Most days,

506
23:31.760 --> 23:34.890
we ate the pickles

507
23:34.890 --> 23:36.890
and broad bean paste my mother made.

508
23:38.090 --> 23:39.420
Every Chinese New Year,

509
23:39.750 --> 23:42.510
she would somehow manage to get a little meat.

510
23:43.480 --> 23:45.730
There were so many children in the family

511
23:45.730 --> 23:48.290
that each of us got only one slice.

512
23:50.090 --> 23:52.000
Mother would say, "Kids,

513
23:52.140 --> 23:53.740
eat slowly. Take your time."

514
23:55.440 --> 23:58.440
We would all eat as slowly as possible.

515
23:59.040 --> 23:59.770
And my mother

516
23:59.860 --> 24:02.660
would sit beside us, smiling as she watched us eat.

517
24:04.960 --> 24:06.960
After I left home to make my way in the world,

518
24:06.960 --> 24:08.760
whenever there was a festival

519
24:09.480 --> 24:12.850
or I had something good to eat,

520
24:13.130 --> 24:15.930
I would always picture her—

521
24:16.670 --> 24:17.810
my dear mother smiling

522
24:17.810 --> 24:19.270
as she watched us eat meat.

523
24:21.040 --> 24:21.720
Come on.

524
24:22.500 --> 24:25.700
Let's keep eating and talking.

525
24:27.810 --> 24:29.040
What I remember most

526
24:29.490 --> 24:32.920
are my mother's eyes, swollen from crying.

527
24:33.570 --> 24:34.570
When I was a child,

528
24:35.090 --> 24:36.690
I was terribly mischievous.

529
24:37.000 --> 24:38.800
One day, I came home from school,

530
24:39.410 --> 24:42.000
and my mother asked me to recite a passage.

531
24:43.410 --> 24:44.470
She couldn't read,

532
24:44.810 --> 24:46.870
so I rattled off a few lines at random.

533
24:48.440 --> 24:50.560
My father heard me reciting from the next room

534
24:50.560 --> 24:52.290
and gave me a terrible beating.

535
24:52.930 --> 24:54.530
And my mom didn't even stop him.

536
24:54.530 --> 24:56.390
At the time, I resented her for it.

537
24:56.410 --> 24:57.610
But the next morning,

538
24:58.130 --> 25:00.200
I saw that her eyes

539
25:01.240 --> 25:02.900
were swollen to narrow slits.

540
25:04.420 --> 25:06.420
Then I knew how deeply I had hurt her.

541
25:13.440 --> 25:14.810
What I remember most

542
25:16.500 --> 25:18.650
are also my mothers' eyes.

543
25:22.290 --> 25:23.890
Why do I say "mothers?"

544
25:24.960 --> 25:26.620
Because I have three mothers.

545
25:26.720 --> 25:27.610
My birth mother

546
25:27.770 --> 25:29.480
had big, double-lidded eyes—

547
25:30.040 --> 25:31.100
bright and lively.

548
25:31.570 --> 25:34.610
Chao always says my eyes look like hers.

549
25:37.240 --> 25:38.200
My aunt...

550
25:39.180 --> 25:41.660
had small eyes, but they were full of wisdom.

551
25:42.570 --> 25:44.040
She was my first teacher.

552
25:44.380 --> 25:47.250
At the age of 11, I was already running the household.

553
25:47.250 --> 25:50.040
Every day, I wrote down the things to do

554
25:50.040 --> 25:52.440
in a notebook,

555
25:52.680 --> 25:54.540
and then finished them one by one.

556
25:55.440 --> 25:56.770
She taught me to do that.

557
25:57.200 --> 25:58.480
I have another mother,

558
25:58.650 --> 25:59.890
my wet nurse.

559
26:00.570 --> 26:01.240
At that time,

560
26:01.240 --> 26:02.590
I was studying in Tianjin.

561
26:02.590 --> 26:04.450
She missed me and wanted to see me,

562
26:05.160 --> 26:08.420
so she borrowed money at a high interest rate just to see me.

563
26:08.850 --> 26:10.520
I will never forget

564
26:12.480 --> 26:15.520
the look in her eyes when she saw me.

565
26:25.340 --> 26:28.890
What I remember most is my mother standing at the door

566
26:29.810 --> 26:31.280
to see me off.

567
26:32.080 --> 26:34.010
Back then, I was leaving Pingxiang

568
26:34.200 --> 26:36.860
to take part in the student movement in Wuchang.

569
26:37.090 --> 26:40.000
My family knew about it and tried to stop me from going.

570
26:40.000 --> 26:42.580
I stood at the door and asked my mother.

571
26:43.150 --> 26:46.990
[Kai Feng (He Kequan), Alternate Member of the Politburo of the CPC Central Committee]

572
26:43.440 --> 26:44.370
I said, "Mother,

573
26:45.030 --> 26:47.710
do you want me to be a sparrow

574
26:48.290 --> 26:49.440
or an eagle?"

575
26:50.440 --> 26:51.650
My mother said to me,

576
26:52.110 --> 26:54.510
"Sparrow or eagle, it makes no difference.

577
26:55.110 --> 26:57.220
I know your wings have grown strong

578
26:57.680 --> 26:59.610
and I can't keep you here anymore."

579
27:01.410 --> 27:02.810
Speaking of my wet nurse,

580
27:03.480 --> 27:05.870
I can still hear her laughter.

581
27:06.280 --> 27:08.420
Because her laughter was so distinctive

582
27:08.420 --> 27:10.630
that once she started, she couldn't stop.

583
27:10.630 --> 27:13.420
Once I fell into a muddy ditch,

584
27:14.760 --> 27:17.280
I went to her in tears, feeling wronged.

585
27:17.650 --> 27:19.780
But the moment she saw me, she laughed,

586
27:20.090 --> 27:22.330
and she couldn't stop laughing,

587
27:22.680 --> 27:25.130
making the whole family laugh along with her.

588
27:25.130 --> 27:26.280
In the end, they laughed so much

589
27:26.280 --> 27:28.210
that I forgot why I had been crying.

590
27:31.410 --> 27:33.330
I miss her laughter so much now.

591
27:33.930 --> 27:36.440
And what was your mother's laugh like?

592
27:38.040 --> 27:39.330
She followed strict etiquette.

593
27:39.330 --> 27:41.130
She never showed her teeth when she smiled,

594
27:41.130 --> 27:43.390
and her breath was louder than her voice.

595
27:43.450 --> 27:44.400
Let me show you.

596
27:49.570 --> 27:50.370
Wait a minute.

597
28:01.510 --> 28:02.830
No, no, I can't.

598
28:06.330 --> 28:07.530
No, I can't hold it in.

599
28:17.600 --> 28:18.530
Comrade Bo Gu,

600
28:19.090 --> 28:20.690
don't just sit there eating.

601
28:21.270 --> 28:23.070
Tell us about your mother too.

602
28:28.670 --> 28:29.930
What I can never forget

603
28:31.200 --> 28:33.090
is my mother standing on the dock.

604
28:34.090 --> 28:35.370
When I was 14,

605
28:36.130 --> 28:39.410
I went from Wuxi to Suzhou to study.

606
28:39.760 --> 28:42.170
My mom saw me onto the boat.

607
28:42.930 --> 28:43.990
As the boat set off,

608
28:44.370 --> 28:45.700
she shouted at the boat.

609
28:46.200 --> 28:47.330
I heard her say,

610
28:48.170 --> 28:49.980
"May you return safely soon."

611
28:50.610 --> 28:52.720
But the boat went further and further away

612
28:52.720 --> 28:54.580
and my mother was still shouting.

613
28:54.930 --> 28:56.720
I didn't hear clearly what she was saying.

614
28:56.720 --> 28:58.520
I could only see her lips moving.

615
28:59.130 --> 29:02.530
I've spent my whole life wondering what she was trying to say.

616
29:02.570 --> 29:04.300
To this day, I still don't know.

617
29:06.890 --> 29:14.900
♪ Mama calls me home for supper ♪

618
29:15.630 --> 29:24.520
♪ And I want to count the stars above ♪

619
29:24.650 --> 29:26.930
We've talked so much about mothers today.

620
29:25.990 --> 29:34.390
♪ Each one twinkling so bright ♪

621
29:27.480 --> 29:29.680
Shouldn't we talk about our fathers too?

622
29:29.680 --> 29:32.080
Otherwise, our fathers might get jealous.

623
29:35.240 --> 29:36.170
Comrade Zedong,

624
29:35.530 --> 29:45.340
♪ Winking at me continuously ♪

625
29:36.570 --> 29:37.720
you go first.

626
29:39.240 --> 29:40.890
Actually, just now,

627
29:41.330 --> 29:43.060
when I was talking about my mom,

628
29:43.440 --> 29:45.570
I was already talking about my father.

629
29:46.680 --> 29:48.680
Which part was about your father?

630
29:48.960 --> 29:49.930
I just said

631
29:50.570 --> 29:53.520
my mother prepared food for me

632
29:54.610 --> 29:55.850
and covered for me.

633
29:56.720 --> 29:58.720
Who was she covering for me against?

634
30:03.960 --> 30:05.720
While these central leaders

635
30:05.720 --> 30:07.480
celebrated the New Year

636
30:07.480 --> 30:09.610
in a cold village in southern Sichuan,

637
30:09.680 --> 30:11.520
other Red Army units

638
30:11.520 --> 30:13.330
were spending New Year's Eve of 1935

639
30:13.330 --> 30:16.280
in their own ways.

640
30:15.700 --> 30:19.520
[Wengong Ridge, Lantian, Shaanxi]

641
30:16.810 --> 30:20.330
Deep in the ravines of Wengong Ridge in Lantian, Shaanxi,

642
30:20.610 --> 30:22.610
the commanders and fighters of the 25th Red Army

643
30:22.610 --> 30:24.650
lay in ambush amid the cold mist,

644
30:24.810 --> 30:27.890
waiting to strike the 126th Brigade of the Shaanxi Army

645
30:27.890 --> 30:30.170
as it moved toward the base area over the New Year period.

646
30:30.170 --> 30:32.950
Their New Year's Eve dinner was the cold northwest wind

647
30:32.950 --> 30:34.360
and hard, dry potatoes.

648
30:35.450 --> 30:38.140
To cooperate with the Central Red Army crossing the river to the north,

649
30:36.380 --> 30:40.240
[Ningqiang County, Southern Shaanxi]

650
30:38.170 --> 30:39.480
the 4th Front Army

651
30:39.480 --> 30:41.960
launched the Southern Shaanxi Campaign

652
30:41.960 --> 30:44.040
in the Ningqiang area of southern Shaanxi.

653
30:44.040 --> 30:45.890
Their hurried march

654
30:45.890 --> 30:48.000
and broke the silence of the old year.

655
30:48.570 --> 30:51.330
Thousands of miles to the east, in the Dayong area of Hunan,

656
30:50.210 --> 30:53.970
[Dayong Area, Hunan]

657
30:51.480 --> 30:52.680
the 2nd and 6th Red Army Corps

658
30:52.680 --> 30:54.960
were holding a meeting on how to respond to the Nationalist forces'

659
30:54.960 --> 30:57.760
encirclement campaign against the Hunan-Hubei-Sichuan-Guizhou

660
30:57.760 --> 30:59.220
revolutionary base area.

661
30:59.570 --> 31:02.850
The bonfire was blazing, and the discussion was in full swing.

662
31:02.850 --> 31:04.090
Further east,

663
31:04.200 --> 31:07.630
[Yudu, Jiangxi]

664
31:04.280 --> 31:06.250
in distant Yudu, southern Jiangxi,

665
31:06.250 --> 31:08.720
the only remaining corner of the Central Soviet Area

666
31:08.720 --> 31:11.200
was gradually being encroached upon by enemy force.

667
31:11.200 --> 31:12.960
The situation was critical.

668
31:13.480 --> 31:15.650
Xiang Ying and other members of the Central Bureau

669
31:15.650 --> 31:18.370
were still divided over whether

670
31:18.370 --> 31:20.370
they should break out immediately.

671
31:21.330 --> 31:21.890
At that time,

672
31:21.890 --> 31:24.090
communists across China

673
31:24.090 --> 31:25.810
were all facing urgent challenges

674
31:25.810 --> 31:27.890
that demanded immediate solutions.

675
31:28.080 --> 31:30.390
And since October 1934,

676
31:30.440 --> 31:32.170
Chiang Kai-shek had assembled an army

677
31:32.170 --> 31:33.520
of more than 40,000 troops in five divisions

678
31:33.520 --> 31:35.760
to launch a second "encirclement" campaign against

679
31:35.760 --> 31:37.960
the two Soviet areas in northern Shaanxi and the Shaanxi-Gansu border region.

680
31:37.960 --> 31:40.280
The enemy's "encirclement" is fierce.

681
31:38.130 --> 31:40.480
[Chiyuan County, Shaanxi (now within Zichang City)]

682
31:40.560 --> 31:42.700
[Ma Mingfang, Chairman of the Northern Shaanxi Provincial Soviet Government]

683
31:41.090 --> 31:42.420
The top priority now

684
31:42.780 --> 31:44.990
[Guo Hongtao, Political Commissar of the General Headquarters of the Northern Shaanxi Guerrillas of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

685
31:43.000 --> 31:46.410
is to unify the leadership of the two Soviet areas

686
31:44.990 --> 31:48.150
[Xie Zichang, Commander-in-Chief of the General Headquarters of the Northern Shaanxi Guerrillas of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army]

687
31:46.610 --> 31:49.470
in Northern Shaanxi and the Shaanxi-Gansu border.

688
31:51.200 --> 31:52.200
Comrade Zichang.

689
31:54.020 --> 31:55.380
Comrade Zhidan is here.

690
31:55.650 --> 31:56.170
Comrade Zichang.

691
31:56.170 --> 31:57.850
Come, help me up quickly.

692
32:00.210 --> 32:01.700
[Liu Zhidan, Chairman of the Revolutionary Military Commission of the Shaanxi-Gansu Border Region]

693
32:01.610 --> 32:02.300
Comrade Zichang.

694
32:02.300 --> 32:02.950
Comrade Zichang.

695
32:02.950 --> 32:05.470
Comrade Zhidan, you're finally here.

696
32:05.820 --> 32:07.090
Why are you out of bed?

697
32:07.760 --> 32:08.890
How are you feeling?

698
32:09.120 --> 32:11.630
Just some old problems. Don't worry.

699
32:11.850 --> 32:13.000
I know

700
32:13.000 --> 32:14.390
my own condition well enough.

701
32:14.390 --> 32:16.650
Comrade Zichang, take care of yourself.

702
32:17.130 --> 32:18.040
Listen to me.

703
32:18.480 --> 32:19.890
I invited you here this time

704
32:19.890 --> 32:22.470
to discuss something

705
32:22.490 --> 32:23.590
extremely urgent.

706
32:23.720 --> 32:24.090
Okay.

707
32:24.090 --> 32:25.000
Come, sit down.

708
32:31.250 --> 32:32.200
Comrade Zhidan,

709
32:33.290 --> 32:35.130
ever since the failure of the Great Revolution,

710
32:35.130 --> 32:36.130
the two of us

711
32:36.440 --> 32:39.370
launched the Qingjian and Weihua uprisings,

712
32:39.680 --> 32:40.570
raised forces,

713
32:40.890 --> 32:42.170
organized more uprisings,

714
32:42.170 --> 32:43.520
and established Soviet base areas.

715
32:43.520 --> 32:44.920
After many ups and downs,

716
32:45.090 --> 32:47.200
we managed to set up two base areas

717
32:47.690 --> 32:50.440
and formed the 26th and 27th Red Armies.

718
32:50.890 --> 32:53.170
But the two forces were under the separate command of the

719
32:53.170 --> 32:57.000
Shaanxi-Gansu Border Special Committee and the Northern Shaanxi Special Committee.

720
32:57.000 --> 32:59.200
We can't fight as a unified force.

721
33:00.610 --> 33:04.410
The year before last, I went to Chahar to join the Anti-Japanese Army

722
33:04.680 --> 33:06.480
In the Party's Front Committee,

723
33:06.960 --> 33:09.680
I fought the Japanese alongside General Ji Hongchang.

724
33:09.680 --> 33:11.330
The problem we faced then

725
33:11.700 --> 33:13.990
was how to establish a unified command

726
33:14.440 --> 33:16.040
and concentrate our forces.

727
33:16.530 --> 33:17.530
Now,

728
33:18.090 --> 33:19.930
the enemy's second "encirclement" campaign

729
33:19.930 --> 33:21.100
is about to begin.

730
33:21.130 --> 33:23.810
We can't go on like this.

731
33:25.090 --> 33:26.250
Are you saying

732
33:26.680 --> 33:28.500
we should unify the leadership of the two Soviet areas

733
33:28.500 --> 33:29.200
and put the 26th and 27th Red Armies

734
33:29.200 --> 33:31.350
under a unified command to fight the enemy?

735
33:31.350 --> 33:32.150
Yes.

736
33:32.890 --> 33:34.650
With one fist, we cannot win.

737
33:34.930 --> 33:38.440
With both fists, we can strike and defend effectively,

738
33:38.930 --> 33:40.250
advance or retreat as needed,

739
33:40.250 --> 33:42.410
and leave no weaknesses for the enemy to exploit.

740
33:42.410 --> 33:43.300
Great.

741
33:43.410 --> 33:45.450
We see eye to eye on this.

742
33:46.010 --> 33:47.880
How about this?

743
33:48.680 --> 33:49.990
Let's just hold a joint meeting

744
33:49.990 --> 33:51.440
of the Party's Northern Shaanxi Special Committee

745
33:51.440 --> 33:53.720
and the Shaanxi-Gansu Border Special Committee.

746
33:53.720 --> 33:55.580
We can merge the two Soviet areas,

747
33:55.680 --> 33:58.040
establish the Party's Northwest Working Committee

748
33:58.040 --> 34:00.890
to unify the leadership of the two Soviet Areas' governments.

749
34:00.890 --> 34:04.010
And then we establish a Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission

750
34:04.010 --> 34:06.010
to direct all military operations.

751
34:06.810 --> 34:07.610
Good.

752
34:07.910 --> 34:09.760
This needs to be done quickly,

753
34:10.480 --> 34:11.409
without delay.

754
34:12.679 --> 34:14.900
I wonder how the Central Red Army's

755
34:15.120 --> 34:17.179
strategic shift is progressing now.

756
34:17.560 --> 34:19.489
We must hold on to the Soviet Areas,

757
34:20.120 --> 34:22.409
so when we re-establish contact with the Central Committee in the future,

758
34:22.409 --> 34:24.210
we can come under its leadership

759
34:24.409 --> 34:26.179
and carry out its directives.

760
34:29.630 --> 34:31.800
On February 5, 1935,

761
34:32.440 --> 34:34.330
the joint meeting of the CPC Shaanxi-Gansu Border Special Committee

762
34:34.330 --> 34:36.989
and the CPC Northern Shaanxi Special Committee

763
34:37.120 --> 34:39.480
was held in Zhoujiaxian, Chiyuan County.

764
34:39.810 --> 34:40.940
The meeting decided

765
34:41.040 --> 34:43.730
to establish the CPC Northwest Working Committee

766
34:43.730 --> 34:45.520
and the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission

767
34:45.520 --> 34:48.000
of the Chinese Workers' and Peasants' Red Army

768
34:48.000 --> 34:50.889
to exercise unified leadership over the two Soviet areas,

769
34:50.889 --> 34:52.690
and to exercise unified command

770
34:52.690 --> 34:54.440
over the Red Army and guerrilla forces.

771
34:54.440 --> 34:57.290
Xie Zichang and Liu Zhidan were elected Chairman and Vice-Chairman,

772
34:57.290 --> 35:00.810
respectively, of Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission.

773
35:00.810 --> 35:03.440
On February 21, 1935,

774
35:03.550 --> 35:05.140
Xie Zichang, one of the principal founders

775
35:05.140 --> 35:07.080
of the Northern Shaanxi Red Army and Soviet base area,

776
35:07.080 --> 35:08.690
died of illness,

777
35:09.000 --> 35:11.040
at the age of only 38.

778
35:11.180 --> 35:12.460
Liu Zhidan succeeded him

779
35:12.460 --> 35:15.340
as Chairman of the Northwest Revolutionary Military Commission.

780
35:13.510 --> 35:20.460
[The Sichuan-Guizhou-Yunnan Border Region]

781
35:36.660 --> 35:38.120
Surrounded by mountains,

782
35:38.560 --> 35:40.220
the place has towering peaks,

783
35:40.350 --> 35:41.930
clear waters, deep valleys and forests.

784
35:41.930 --> 35:43.260
What a wonderful place.

785
35:43.510 --> 35:44.240
Bocheng.

786
35:44.880 --> 35:45.850
What is this place?

787
35:45.850 --> 35:49.290
This is where Sichuan, Guizhou, and Yunnan meet.

788
35:49.820 --> 35:51.570
Our campsite is just ahead.

789
35:51.770 --> 35:52.970
It's a small village.

790
35:53.040 --> 35:53.730
Over there,

791
35:53.960 --> 35:56.340
a rooster's crow can be heard in all three provinces.

792
35:56.340 --> 35:57.940
Now that the Red Army is here,

793
35:58.000 --> 35:59.640
we'll make our presence felt in all three provinces.

794
35:59.640 --> 36:01.140
No matter which province we go to,

795
36:01.140 --> 36:02.250
the warlords there

796
36:02.810 --> 36:05.040
will tremble with fear.

797
36:05.960 --> 36:07.000
Let them tremble.

798
36:09.160 --> 36:09.810
Let's go.

799
36:10.000 --> 36:12.330
Comrade Enlai, come here.

800
36:17.570 --> 36:20.000
There's something I want to discuss with you.

801
36:20.000 --> 36:20.810
Go ahead.

802
36:21.440 --> 36:24.890
I'd like to formally propose at the Politburo meeting

803
36:24.960 --> 36:26.890
to change the Party's leadership

804
36:27.690 --> 36:30.600
and redistribute responsibilities among the members of the Standing Committee.

805
36:30.600 --> 36:32.260
I'd like to hear your reasons.

806
36:32.520 --> 36:33.880
At the Zunyi Conference,

807
36:33.880 --> 36:36.330
Comrade Bo Gu came under heavy criticism.

808
36:36.560 --> 36:37.890
If he remains in charge,

809
36:38.410 --> 36:39.930
it will be difficult for him to continue,

810
36:39.930 --> 36:42.640
and he'd struggle to retain the others' support.

811
36:42.640 --> 36:44.440
Besides, I've noticed

812
36:45.000 --> 36:47.040
that Comrade Bo Gu

813
36:47.480 --> 36:49.560
has been in low spirits for some time.

814
36:50.080 --> 36:52.690
He still hasn't worked things out in his own mind.

815
36:52.690 --> 36:53.750
If this continues,

816
36:53.890 --> 36:56.490
it will only make it harder for him to do his job.

817
36:57.480 --> 36:58.370
Have you discussed this

818
36:58.370 --> 37:00.120
with other comrades?

819
37:00.460 --> 37:02.590
I've discussed it with Comrade Zedong

820
37:02.650 --> 37:03.700
and Comrade Jiaxiang,

821
37:03.700 --> 37:05.530
and they both agree.

822
37:08.950 --> 37:13.030
Do you have anyone in mind

823
37:15.210 --> 37:16.740
for the Party's new leader?

824
37:17.100 --> 37:20.300
Comrade Mao Zedong'd be the right person for the job.

825
37:21.930 --> 37:23.130
We see it the same way.

826
37:23.480 --> 37:24.280
I believe that

827
37:24.480 --> 37:26.610
most of our comrades feel the same way.

828
37:27.410 --> 37:29.770
But we must speak frankly

829
37:30.810 --> 37:32.000
with Comrade Bo Gu.

830
37:32.600 --> 37:35.250
We mustn't let this undermine Party unity.

831
37:37.440 --> 37:40.240
This is the first time our Party has independently

832
37:40.270 --> 37:42.200
made personnel decisions within the Central Committee.

833
37:42.200 --> 37:43.860
We must proceed with caution.

834
37:44.850 --> 37:45.450
Well then,

835
37:45.620 --> 37:46.820
when we reach camp,

836
37:46.850 --> 37:48.510
I'll speak with Comrade Bo Gu.

837
37:48.640 --> 37:49.570
I believe Bo Gu is

838
37:49.640 --> 37:52.700
a comrade who values discipline and the Party's unity.

839
37:53.480 --> 37:55.740
You're the best person to speak with him.

840
38:45.850 --> 38:46.730
Comrade Bo Gu,

841
38:48.040 --> 38:49.040
you're still up?

842
38:50.800 --> 38:51.710
Comrade Enlai.

843
38:52.640 --> 38:53.500
Please come in.

844
38:53.640 --> 38:54.370
Okay.

845
38:57.040 --> 38:58.170
Sorry to bother you.

846
39:10.250 --> 39:11.080
I came

847
39:11.690 --> 39:14.560
to discuss tomorrow's Politburo meeting agenda

848
39:14.770 --> 39:15.890
with you.

849
39:16.370 --> 39:17.770
What's there to discuss?

850
39:19.250 --> 39:20.650
I made serious mistakes.

851
39:21.440 --> 39:23.300
Now many people want me replaced.

852
39:23.480 --> 39:24.940
Who will take over my work?

853
39:26.160 --> 39:27.290
If I'm not mistaken,

854
39:28.970 --> 39:30.500
it'll be Mao Zedong, right?

855
39:33.050 --> 39:35.340
Indeed, many comrades

856
39:35.810 --> 39:37.410
hope that Comrade Mao Zedong

857
39:37.410 --> 39:39.770
will become the Party's new leader.

858
39:40.440 --> 39:42.250
I personally feel the same way.

859
39:47.330 --> 39:48.850
I'm not surprised at all.

860
39:49.400 --> 39:51.530
You have always supported Mao Zedong.

861
39:52.690 --> 39:53.690
Comrade Bo Gu.

862
39:54.290 --> 39:57.290
I came here to tell you

863
39:57.540 --> 39:59.100
why I support Mao Zedong.

864
39:59.480 --> 40:01.840
I believe you'll hear me out.

865
40:02.690 --> 40:04.490
How do you know I'll hear you out?

866
40:04.710 --> 40:05.990
Because I know you,

867
40:06.370 --> 40:07.770
and I trust you even more.

868
40:08.920 --> 40:11.440
After the May 30th Movement,

869
40:11.730 --> 40:14.330
you were only 18, yet you cried out in anguish,

870
40:14.440 --> 40:17.290
"When our country is in peril, how can I think only of myself?"

871
40:17.290 --> 40:20.690
You must be someone who always prioritizes the greater good.

872
40:33.600 --> 40:34.770
Things from my youth

873
40:35.120 --> 40:36.580
are not worth mentioning.

874
40:42.190 --> 40:43.060
Comrade Bo Gu,

875
40:43.480 --> 40:46.480
you and I have spent too long living off foreign ideas.

876
40:46.890 --> 40:48.210
With all due respect,

877
40:48.570 --> 40:50.030
we have a common weakness—

878
40:50.160 --> 40:52.490
our understanding of China's conditions

879
40:52.610 --> 40:54.140
is far less deep or thorough

880
40:54.210 --> 40:56.410
than Comrade Zedong's understanding.

881
41:00.440 --> 41:01.770
This isn't

882
41:02.560 --> 41:04.640
a conclusion I just came up with.

883
41:05.410 --> 41:07.010
I'd like to hear the details.

884
41:07.040 --> 41:07.900
In 1928,

885
41:09.440 --> 41:12.250
I attended the 6th National Congress of the CPC in Moscow,

886
41:12.250 --> 41:13.650
which you also attended.

887
41:13.930 --> 41:14.890
At that time,

888
41:14.890 --> 41:18.120
you interpreted for the leaders of the Communist International.

889
41:18.120 --> 41:21.080
And I made two points at the meeting.

890
41:22.570 --> 41:23.380
First,

891
41:23.680 --> 41:27.200
I discussed the failure of the Nanchang Uprising.

892
41:29.160 --> 41:29.960
Second,

893
41:34.080 --> 41:36.890
I spoke about how Comrade Mao Zedong

894
41:37.160 --> 41:40.560
had independently opened up a new path in Jinggang Mountain.

895
41:41.000 --> 41:43.290
That's when I realized

896
41:43.410 --> 41:46.850
if the Chinese revolution were led by people like you and me,

897
41:47.040 --> 41:49.730
we might have the will, but not the ability.

898
41:53.520 --> 41:54.690
Then tell me,

899
41:54.880 --> 41:57.850
how does Mao Zedong understand China's conditions?

900
42:01.000 --> 42:03.460
When you arrived in the Central Soviet Area,

901
42:04.160 --> 42:08.090
you criticized Comrade Zedong for lacking Marxist-Leninist theory.

902
42:08.930 --> 42:10.000
But think about it,

903
42:10.520 --> 42:12.480
does he really have no theoretical understanding at all?

904
42:12.480 --> 42:13.370
He does.

905
42:13.480 --> 42:16.080
He has a theory more suited to China's reality.

906
42:16.140 --> 42:16.820
He summarized

907
42:16.820 --> 42:18.640
his theory from the remote rural areas.

908
42:18.640 --> 42:20.290
And it's better suited to China's conditions.

909
42:20.290 --> 42:22.250
He has done so many investigations.

910
42:22.250 --> 42:24.690
And what investigations

911
42:25.080 --> 42:26.740
have you and I ever conducted?

912
42:27.250 --> 42:28.750
Even if we had conducted investigations,

913
42:28.750 --> 42:30.750
could we write "Report from Xunwu,"

914
42:30.850 --> 42:32.930
"Report from Xingguo"

915
42:32.930 --> 42:34.600
or "Report from Changgang Township?"

916
42:34.600 --> 42:36.450
Could we propose our own vision

917
42:36.480 --> 42:38.560
for the future of the Chinese revolution?

918
42:38.560 --> 42:39.820
The same goes for Li De.

919
42:41.600 --> 42:43.520
The fundamental reason the military line

920
42:43.520 --> 42:44.560
was wrong was that

921
42:44.860 --> 42:46.370
he lacked a profound understanding

922
42:46.370 --> 42:48.790
of the underlying reality of the Chinese revolution—

923
42:48.790 --> 42:50.850
the enemy was strong and we were weak.

924
42:50.890 --> 42:54.250
When you went to the Guangchang front to direct the battle yourselves,

925
42:54.250 --> 42:55.560
and we Troika

926
42:55.810 --> 42:57.800
designed the strategic shift plan,

927
42:57.800 --> 43:01.190
did any one of us go to the front to speak with corps commanders

928
43:01.190 --> 43:03.150
and carry out any serious field research?
